{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09695","headline":"裴将军宅芦管歌 · 岑参","name":"裴将军宅芦管歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辽东九月芦叶断，辽东小儿采芦管。\n可怜新管清且悲，一曲风飘海头满。\n海树萧索天雨霜，管声寥亮月苍苍。\n白狼河北堪愁恨，玄兔城南皆断肠。\n辽东将军长安宅，美人芦管会佳客。\n弄调啾飕胜洞箫，发声窈窕欺横笛。\n夜半高堂客未回，祗将芦管送君杯。\n巧能陌上惊杨柳，复向园中误落梅。\n诸客爱之听未足，高卷珠帘列红烛。\n将军醉舞不肯休，更使美人吹一曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09695.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09695","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}